  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government Financial Management and Revenue Administration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In light of the more limited scope of GFMRAP after the recommended restructuring, the overall Project Development Objective is changed to the following:   The objective of the Project is to improve efficiency, governance, integrity and transparency in the Borrower&apos;s public financial management.  This adjustment scales down the ambition by focusing on public expenditure management and by not being the overarching reform umbrella envisioned in the Project Appraisal Document.</narrative>
  </description>
